{"step_index":900,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T21:06:34Z","content":"**A comprehensive Database Backup Export & Multi-Source Recovery System has been added and deployed live!**\n\n---\n\n### How the New Backup & Recovery System Works:\n\n#### 📤 1. Exporting & Backing Up Your Pipeline:\nIn **Settings ⚙️ $\\rightarrow$ Database Backup & Recovery**:\n- **Export Backup File (`.json`)**: \n  - Generates a complete timestamped snapshot file (`SnapDialer_ValuTeachers_Backup_2026-08-20.json`).\n  - Triggers your device's native share menu so you can save it directly to **iCloud Drive, Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox**, or email it as an attachment via **Mail/Gmail**.\n- **Copy Backup JSON to Clipboard**: \n  - Copies the full database payload to your clipboard with 1 tap, allowing you to paste it into an email draft, note, or document.\n\n---\n\n#### 📥 2. Importing & Recovering Backups:\n- **Import from File / Drive (`.json`)**:\n  - Tapping **\"Import from File / Drive\"** opens your iPhone / device file manager.\n  - You can browse and select any `.json` file located in your **iCloud Drive, Google Drive, OneDrive, Files app, Downloads**, or saved email attachments.\n- **Paste Backup JSON Text**:\n  - If you emailed the backup JSON text or have it stored in notes, open the **\"Paste Backup JSON\"** modal, paste the text, and hit restore.\n- **Merge vs. Clean Overwrite Choice**:\n  - When importing, you are prompted to either:\n    - **Merge with Existing**: Adds the backup leads while keeping your existing contacts intact.\n    - **Clean Overwrite**: Restores the database exactly as it was when the backup was created.\n\n---\n\n#### 🛡️ Data Integrity:\nThe restore engine recovers **100% of your data**:\n- All individual educator cards & report card details (FRS years, planning periods, room numbers, meeting preferences, notes, and photos).\n- Full call log history & timestamps.\n- SMS templates & follow-up cadence rules.\n- Settings (your Gemini API key and caller name).\n\n---\n\n### Live Link (Updated & Live):\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\n\nOpen **Settings ⚙️** in SnapDialer on your iPhone to test the new export and import workflows!"}
